s are disabled</a>. Food and drink requirements were removed.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#spell-access\">Early scribing</a> allows eligible scrolls into the spellbook before their casting level.</li><li><a href=\"equipment.html#selling\">Sell All protects food, drink, reagents and casting focus items</a>.</li><li>The launcher uses personal access codes and shows <a href=\"launcher.html#patch-notes\">patch summaries</a>.</li><li>Waypoint portals and floating-eye Instance Keepers received visual corrections. The reported pet-summon crash was confirmed resolved.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-9\">October 9, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"zones.html\">48 Classic reward zones</a>, <a href=\"items.html\">384 reward variants</a>, type-22 augments and zone forging launched.</li><li>Passive AA increased to 40% at that time; the October 13 reduction above supersedes that rate.</li><li><a href=\"advanced-loot.html#row-controls\">Always Loot / Never Loot controls</a>, effective Spell Damage on <a href=\"combat.html#throw-stone\">Throw Stone</a>, and retained spell gems after normal death were added.</li></ul><p>Release labels describe availability, not completed balance or gameplay acceptance. See <a href=\"unreleased.html\">In development</a> for candidates.</p>",
